- User says "3" → {"intent": "index_selection", "selected_indexes": [3], "reasoning": "User selected employee 3"}
- User says "cancel" → {"intent": "cancel", "selected_indexes": [], "reasoning": "User wants to cancel"}

Respond with ONLY valid JSON:
